      "description": "Request stopping of one execution and its descendants. Observe quiescence; cancellation does not undo external effects or resolve unknown outcomes. Preserve expected_revision from the original owner/instance read. For step writes preserve execution_id and expected_step_revision from that same read; do not refresh or retry conflicts with newer versions. Changes to control_version or plan_revision_id revoke the old request."
